#: ../../source/trace-mapping_README.md:5
msgid ""
"`trace-mapping` allows you to take the line and column of an output file "
"and trace it to the original location in the source file through a source"
" map."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/trace-mapping_README.md:8
msgid ""
"You may already be familiar with the [`source-map`][source-map] package's"
" `SourceMapConsumer`. This provides the same `originalPositionFor` and "
"`generatedPositionFor` API, without requiring WASM."
msgstr ""

