#: ../../source/trace-mapping_README.md:79
msgid ""
"The sourcemap spec defines a special `sections` field that's designed to "
"handle concatenation of output code with associated sourcemaps. This type"
" of sourcemap is rarely used (no major build tool produces it), but if "
"you are hand coding a concatenation you may need it. We provide an "
"`AnyMap` helper that can receive either a regular sourcemap or a "
